    "updated_at": "2025-11-19T21:43:07Z",
    "body": "> One minor point: it seems like since insert 7.1 does adopt, perhaps insert 7.7.3.1 and 7.7.4.1 are no longer needed?\r\n\r\n@sorvell My understanding is that the scoped document set is used for searching for upgrade candidates in the case of new definition added, so we'll need to keep those two steps around.",
